sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as Scheduled job (GitHub Actions)
    participant API as API (Express)
    participant FX as Frankfurter API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor HR as Global HR manager

    Note over Job,HR: Daily refresh
    Job->>API: POST /api/internal/fx-rates/refresh with the shared secret
    API->>API: Check the secret
    API->>FX: GET latest rates, base USD, for CAD, AUD and INR
    FX-->>API: Rates and their date
    API->>DB: Upsert one row per currency and rate date
    API-->>Job: 200 with the stored date, or an error that fails the job

    Note over Job,HR: Manual refresh
    HR->>API: POST /api/fx-rates/refresh (global HR only)
    API->>FX: Same fetch and store
    API-->>HR: Rates and their date

    Note over Job,HR: Reading
    API->>DB: Latest rate on or before today for each currency
    API-->>HR: Amounts converted to USD, with the date of the rates shown
